### 2. Tool Preparation

- Tool APIs (for optimization)

    | Module                  | Functions |
    |-------------------------|-----------|
    | [index_selection](multiagents/tools/index_advisor) (equipped)          | *heuristic* algorithm  |
    | [query_rewrite](multiagents/tools/query_advisor) (equipped)           | *45* rules  |
