oci_data_science.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/chat_models/oci_data_science.py,bc5f4c4a765022bb5bd9f07376eb0f8b34fec460,shhriya/rag_tech_debt,https://api.github.com/repositories/983613332/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/chat_models/oci_data_science.py?ref=853883058d848c600af9bf46bc43392cbde7c6c2,https://api.github.com/repositories/983613332/git/blobs/bc5f4c4a765022bb5bd9f07376eb0f8b34fec460,https://github.com/shhriya/rag_tech_debt/blob/853883058d848c600af9bf46bc43392cbde7c6c2/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/chat_models/oci_data_science.py,,,0,0,0,9,2025-05-15T04:37:30Z,0,0,"#  Tech Debt QnA API

A **RAG-based (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)** FastAPI service to answer technical debt questions using a PDF dataset and Gemini 1.5.  
It also exposes project-wise metrics extracted from the PDF, such as **code smells, refactorings, and faults** for Apache projects.

---

##  Features

- 🤖 Ask natural language questions about technical debt using Gemini + LangChain
- 📊 View project-wise metrics: code smells, faults, and refactorings
- 📎 Auto-parses and indexes `The_Technical_Debt_Dataset.pdf`
- 🧠 Uses `LangChain`, `pdfplumber`, and `Chroma` for RAG-style QnA

---

