###  Getting Started

1. Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/shhriya/rag_tech_debt.git
cd tech_debt_api
2. Create and activate virtual environment
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate         # On Windows
3. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
4. Create a .env file in the root:
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
5. Run the server
cd app
uvicorn main:app --reload

Test with Swagger
Once running, open:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

Test Docker locally
# Build the image
docker build -t tech-debt-api .
# Run it
docker run -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env tech-debt-api



####  API Endpoints
🧠 Ask a question
POST /ask_tech_debt
{
  ""question"": ""What are the most common code smells?""
}


📊 Get project metrics
GET /metrics_summary/{project_name}

Example:
GET /metrics_summary/Apache Hive
📃 List available projects
GET /project_names


