api.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/indexing/api.py,9e1fc237852105a3d0a9a7ff35b0dca75381c822,Samuelms46/RAG-System,https://api.github.com/repositories/1012226931/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/indexing/api.py?ref=377579b936b843232ea125ef2de71cd3ef177412,https://api.github.com/repositories/1012226931/git/blobs/9e1fc237852105a3d0a9a7ff35b0dca75381c822,https://github.com/Samuelms46/RAG-System/blob/377579b936b843232ea125ef2de71cd3ef177412/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/indexing/api.py,This is a repo that consist of a RAG system that I created during the AFTA bootcamp. ,,0,0,0,12,2025-07-11T17:01:08Z,0,0,"# RAG System

A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system built during the AFTA bootcamp, featuring a Streamlit UI and ChromaDB for vector embeddings storage. This system enables intelligent document retrieval and question-answering capabilities.

## 🚀 Features

- **Document Processing**: Text preprocessing and tokenization
- **Vector Embeddings**: Generate and store embeddings using ChromaDB
- **Similarity Search**: Efficient document retrieval based on semantic similarity
- **Interactive UI**: Streamlit-based web interface for easy interaction
- **RAG Pipeline**: Complete retrieval-augmented generation workflow
