runner_utils.py,chatbot/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/smith/evaluation/runner_utils.py,2559c8eb71e3087822b51a620d6602f612dc780f,Aashka1/Model,https://api.github.com/repositories/791946950/contents/chatbot/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/smith/evaluation/runner_utils.py?ref=c87e2c9636770e07fd4db008c98deb90b06173a3,https://api.github.com/repositories/791946950/git/blobs/2559c8eb71e3087822b51a620d6602f612dc780f,https://github.com/Aashka1/Model/blob/c87e2c9636770e07fd4db008c98deb90b06173a3/chatbot/myenv/Lib/site-packages/langchain/smith/evaluation/runner_utils.py,,,0,0,0,8,2025-05-19T11:45:53Z,0,0,"##Gemini Multi-Purpose Application
Gemini is a versatile application powered by AI technologies that offer various functionalities such as text and voice-based interactions, image description, and PDF chat. This Streamlit-based application integrates several AI models and tools to provide a seamless user experience.

####Features
Text Chatbot: Engage in text-based conversations with an AI chatbot powered by Gemini Pro.
Voice Input: Record voice inputs and receive text-based responses using Google Speech Recognition.
Image Description: Upload images and receive textual descriptions generated by the Gemini Pro Vision model.
PDF Chat: Upload PDF documents and interact with a question-answering chatbot that extracts relevant information from the documents.

####Requirements
Ensure you have the following dependencies installed:


Python 3.7+
Streamlit
PyPDF2
Pillow
Langchain
Langchain Google GenAI
SpeechRecognition
Pyttsx3
Sounddevice
Soundfile
Pygame
"
