manager.py,backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,24e42994b125619c1ac8af845a76b2e6108e4e0b,Aditya0049/mcp-doctor-assistant,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024465900/contents/backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py?ref=d5441dc26982efad770966e01b8aa8bbd7628c1d,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024465900/git/blobs/24e42994b125619c1ac8af845a76b2e6108e4e0b,https://github.com/Aditya0049/mcp-doctor-assistant/blob/d5441dc26982efad770966e01b8aa8bbd7628c1d/backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,,,0,0,0,10,2025-07-22T21:06:23Z,0,0,"# 🧠 Smart Doctor Assistant (Agentic AI)

This is a full-stack demo built as part of the FSE Intern Assignment using:

- FastAPI + LangChain + React
- Agentic design with MCP tools (availability, booking, email, report)

## 🚀 Features

- Prompt-based appointment booking via AI
- Summary report generation for doctors
- Conversation memory (multi-turn)

## 🔧 Tech Stack

- Backend: FastAPI, LangChain, MCP-style toolchain
- Frontend: React + Tailwind CSS
- DB: Supabase PostgreSQL (mocked)

## 📦 Setup

```bash
cd backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

# .env file
cp .env.example .env
```

## 🖥️ Run
```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Frontend:
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

## ✨ Sample Prompts

- Book appointment with Dr. Ahuja tomorrow
- How many patients visited yesterday?

---

## 📸 Screenshots

- ![frontend.mp4](demo/screencapture/frontend.mp4)


## 👤 Bonus

- Role-based login (optional)
- Prompt history (optional)
- LLM auto rescheduling (TODO)

---
