manager.py,backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,24e42994b125619c1ac8af845a76b2e6108e4e0b,shreyad2806/LLM-FAQChatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/996018914/contents/backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py?ref=2db09678c5a19ef4dd5ad12ee4616c040ff6ad7c,https://api.github.com/repositories/996018914/git/blobs/24e42994b125619c1ac8af845a76b2e6108e4e0b,https://github.com/shreyad2806/LLM-FAQChatbot/blob/2db09678c5a19ef4dd5ad12ee4616c040ff6ad7c/backend/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,,,0,0,0,3,2025-06-04T11:17:30Z,0,0,"# 🤖 LLM FAQ Chatbot

A lightweight, FastAPI-based chatbot that answers frequently asked questions using an LLM (like OpenAI's GPT) and LangChain — with a simple frontend built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

---

## 🧠 Features

- 🔗 LangChain integration
- ⚡ FastAPI backend with `/ask` endpoint
- 🧩 OpenAI or custom LLM support
- 🖥️ Minimal, no-framework frontend
- 🌍 Ready to deploy on Netlify + Render

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Backend**: FastAPI, LangChain, Pydantic, OpenAI API, FAISS (optional)
- **Frontend**: HTML + CSS + Vanilla JS (no Tailwind or React)
- **Deployment**: Render (API), Netlify (frontend)

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

🌐 Frontend: [your-netlify-link](https://your-frontend.netlify.app)  
⚙️ API: [your-render-api-link](https://your-api.onrender.com)

---
